{"step_index":3498,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T00:19:36Z","input_tokens":27734,"cache_read_tokens":253772,"output_tokens":3651,"thinking":"Updating the stylesheet to apply new visual styling to the code view and current line highlighting. The background for the `.code-view` will be a warm ivory cream with a subtle border and inset shadow for improved readability. The active code line, identified by `.code-row.is-current-line`, will feature a Thonny soft blue highlight bar, a distinct left border color, and top/bottom borders.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update Area 1 code background and add thonny-token-box style in styles.css","EndLine":588,"Instruction":"Set warm ivory code background, Thonny blue line highlight, and thonny-token-box sub-expression highlight","ReplacementContent":".code-view {\n  flex: 1;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  background: var(--bg-code, #ffffec);\n  border: 1px solid #e5e1cf;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 10px 0;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n}\n\n.code-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 2px 10px 2px 0;\n  border-left: 4px solid transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: opacity 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.code-row.is-dimmed {\n  opacity: 0.62;\n}\n\n.code-row.is-dimmed:hover {\n  opacity: 0.95;\n  background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.04);\n}\n\n.code-row.is-current-line {\n  opacity: 1;\n  background: #dbeafe !important;\n  border-left-color: var(--primary-blue) !important;\n  border-top: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  animation: lineEntranceHighlight calc(0.35s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease-out;\n}\n\n.code-gutter {\n  width: 52px;\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 12px;\n  color: #78716c;\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  background: #f7f4e4;\n  border-right: 1px solid #e7e2d2;\n  user-select: none;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  gap: 3px;\n}\n\n.code-gutter-pointer {\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  animation: pointerPulse calc(0.8s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) infinite alternate ease-in-out;\n}\n\n.is-current-line .code-gutter {\n  color: #1d4ed8;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);\n}\n\n.branch-badge {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 1px 7px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  margin-left: 8px;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 3px;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n\n.branch-badge.is-executes {\n  color: #047857;\n  background: #ecfdf5;\n  border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;\n  animation: branchGlow calc(0.5s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease;\n}\n\n.branch-badge.is-skipped {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;\n  text-decoration: line-through;\n}\n\n.code-syntax {\n  white-space: pre;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* Thonny-Style Active Sub-Expression / Word Box */\n.thonny-token-box {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  margin: 0 2px;\n  border: 1.5px solid #0f172a;\n  background: #fef08a;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 0 0 1px rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.5);\n  animation: thonnyTokenPop calc(0.3s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n  vertical-align: baseline;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n@keyframes thonnyTokenPop {\n  0% {\n    transform: scale(0.94);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.6);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: scale(1.05);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);\n  }\n  100% {\n    transform: scale(1);\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n  }\n}\n\n